  "description": {
    "en": "The trade-weighted effective exchange rate of the Swiss franc, the standard summary measure of franc strength, published daily. Two aggregates are offered: the overall index and a euro-area index. As with the bilateral indices, nominal and the two real variants (consumer-price and producer-price deflated) are each given as an index and as a percentage change."
